{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":17,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Prayer of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 17:1"},"Hear the right, O LORD, attend unto my cry, give ear unto my prayer, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that goeth"]}," not out of feigned lips. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 17:2"},"Let my sentence come forth from thy presence; let thine eyes behold the things that are equal. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 17:3"},"Thou hast proved mine heart; thou hast visited ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["me"]}," in the night; thou hast tried me, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," shalt find nothing; I am purposed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," my mouth shall not transgress. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 17:4"},"Concerning the works of men, by the word of thy lips I have kept ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["me from"]}," the paths of the destroyer. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 17:5"},"Hold up my goings in thy paths, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," my footsteps slip not. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 17:6"},"I have called upon thee, for thou wilt hear me, O God: incline thine ear unto me, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and hear"]}," my speech. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 17:7"},"Shew thy marvellous lovingkindness, O thou that savest by thy right hand them which put their trust ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["in thee"]}," from those that rise up ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["against them."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 17:8"},"Keep me as the apple of the eye, hide me under the shadow of thy wings, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 17:9"},"From the wicked that oppress me, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["from"]}," my deadly enemies, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["who"]}," compass me about. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 17:10"},"They are inclosed in their own fat: with their mouth they speak proudly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 17:11"},"They have now compassed us in our steps: they have set their eyes bowing down to the earth; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 17:12"},"Like as a lion ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," is greedy of his prey, and as it were a young lion lurking in secret places. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 17:13"},"Arise, O LORD, disappoint him, cast him down: deliver my soul from the wicked, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which is"]}," thy sword: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 17:14"},"From men ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which are"]}," thy hand, O LORD, from men of the world, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which have"]}," their portion in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["this"]}," life, and whose belly thou fillest with thy hid ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["treasure:"]}," they are full of children, and leave the rest of their ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["substance"]}," to their babes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 17:15"},"As for me, I will behold thy face in righteousness: I shall be satisfied, when I awake, with thy likeness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 17:15"}]}]}
